**[HARD]** Consider the following C code for Insertion Sort. What is the exact number of comparisons and shifts performed on the array `[5, 3, 1, 4, 2]`?

```c
for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {
    int key = arr[i], j = i - 1;
    while (j >= 0 && arr[j] > key) {
        arr[j + 1] = arr[j]; j--;
    }
    arr[j + 1] = key;
}
```
